sequenceDiagram
  actor S as Seller
  actor A as Admin
  participant API as MonitoringService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  S->>API: POST /sellers/me/strikes/:id/appeal {reason}
  API->>DB: strike own and active? no appeal yet?
  API->>DB: insert strike_appeals(pending)
  A->>API: POST /admin/appeals/:id/decision {approve, note}
  alt admin issued the strike
    API-->>A: 403 cannot decide own strike
  else reject without note
    API-->>A: 422 note required
  else approve
    API->>DB: appeal approved, strike revoked
    API->>DB: active strikes < limit -> seller approved again
  end
